{"about_the_game":"Beginning as a submission to the 2023 Big Mode Game Jam, Backpack Boy, a puzzle-platformer built around using special light sources to affect the world around you has been expanded to a full game with new levels and new mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis short experience is packed full of fun and interesting puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore deeper to uncover the mysteries at the heart of the facility.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomething is waiting for you...","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875150?t=1744814844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875150?t=1744814844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744814844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744814844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3121480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Flashlight</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/Gif1_Optomozied_1_cropped_to_616x300.gif?t=1744814844\" /><br>The Flashlight is the first and most important tool in your backpack.  Though, this flashlight doesn't just light up the dark.  It shines its way to <i>somewhere else.</i>  Use it to solve puzzles and explore a dilapidated facility that has been long abandoned.</p><br><h1>Lantern</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/Gif2_Optomozied_1_cropped_to_616x300.gif?t=1744814844\" /><br>The second tool at your disposal is The Lantern.  Endowed with the same power as The Flashlight, these lanterns p